{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"christofidesTour","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cycle","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks5CycleV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Walks\/documentation\/Walks\/Cycle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SignedInteger","preciseIdentifier":"s:SZ","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the canonical minimum spanning tree (weight, then position, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"minimumSpanningTree(weight:)"},{"text":"), a minimum-weight perfect matching on its odd-degree","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"minimumWeightMatching"},{"text":"), and an Eulerian circuit of their union by Hierholzer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the first vertex, shortcut to the first visit of each vertex. The matching is on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"complete graph of the odd vertices in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order (pairs i < j lexicographic), and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"circuit’s multigraph lists the tree edges by position, then the matched pairs in that order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the tour is determined. At most 3\/2 × the shortest tour when the weights satisfy the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"triangle inequality (not checked).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tours read the simple graph, as "},{"code":"nearestNeighborTour(weight:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" documents; nil below three"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices."}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The graph is complete; the sum along a tour fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"W","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"code":"W","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"FixedWidthInteger","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every non-loop edge’s weight satisfies n · (2 · |weight| + 1) ≤","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"W.max \/ 8","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the matching’s bound), checked as each weight is read, so a weight beyond it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"traps even on an edge the matching never sees; so n ≤ ","type":"text"},{"code":"W.max \/ 8","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (15 vertices for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int8","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), whatever the weights. An arbitrary-precision integer has no bound.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Precondition"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n³): the matching on up to n vertices; the tree O(n²)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Christofides’ tour (Christofides 1976; Serdyukov 1978).","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/christofidesTour(weight:)-6qvc8"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"metadata":{"title":"christofidesTour(weight:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Tours"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Christofides.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Tours\/Christofides.swift#L140"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"christofidesTour","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"te